=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Pherimociel} at (G-6) in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} for a cutscene (Home Point #1).
* Head up the stairs and examine the **Audience Chamber** for another cutscene.
** Optional: {n:Pherimociel} and {n:Auchefort} have new minor dialogue after this scene.
* Travel to (H-9) in {z:Selbina} and speak with {n:Mathilde} in the **Weaver's Guild** office to complete the Mission.

=2 Optional
* **Note**: When {p:CoP|Chains of Promathia} first released, this was the last mission available. The remaining missions were added in later updates.
** While the armada is getting ready for its attack, it's a natural stopping point to take a break and wrap up any unfinished business, and start some optional quests that didn't fit anywhere else (see below).
* {q:A Question of Faith|A Question of Faith|A Question of Faith} (level 60+), part of a quest chain.
* ({p:THF} only) {q:The Tenshodo Showdown|The Tenshodo Showdown|The Tenshodo Showdown} (level 40+), {q:As Thick as Thieves|As Thick as Thieves|As Thick as Thieves} (level 50+), and {q:Hitting the Marquisate|Hitting the Marquisate|Hitting the Marquisate} (level 60+)
** These may contain information relevant to your main quest.
* {q:Brygid the Stylist|Brygid the Stylist|Brygid the Stylist} (level 1+), {q:Brygid the Stylist Returns|Brygid the Stylist Returns|Brygid the Stylist Returns} (level 52+)
** The second quest can be triggered by wearing {p:Artifact Armor|Category:Artifact Armor}. It requires a Constellation subligar from the Fomors in the previous CoP dungeons.
* {q:Secrets of Ovens Lost|Secrets of Ovens Lost|Secrets of Ovens Lost} (level 50+) is available after finishing {q:Spice Gals|Spice Gals|Spice Gals} and is also a {p:Records of Eminence 15th Vana'versary IV|Category:Records of Eminence} objective.
* {q:Elderly Pursuits|Elderly Pursuits|Elderly Pursuits} (level 51+) is available after finishing 'Secrets of Ovens Lost'.
* {q:Chips|Chips|Chips} (level 60+) which rewards a boss-weakening item.
* {q:The Naming Game|The Naming Game|The Naming Game} (level 60+), additional completions of this quest allow for renaming after airships from other FF games.
* {q:Tuning In|Tuning In|Tuning In} (level 60+)
** {q:Tuning Out|Tuning Out|Tuning Out} (level 60+) is available after completing 'Tuning In'.
* {q:Behind the Smile|Behind the Smile|Behind the Smile} (level 50+): requires you to have a  {q:mannequin|Mannequin|mannequin}.
** {q:Knocking on Forbidden Doors|Knocking on Forbidden Doors|Knocking on Forbidden Doors} (level 50+) is available after completing 'Behind the Smile'.
* {q:Missionary Moblin|Missionary Moblin|Missionary Moblin} (level 50+)
** {q:For the Birds|For the Birds|For the Birds} (level 50+) is available after completing 'Missionary Moblin'.
** {q:Better the Demon You Know|Better the Demon You Know|Better the Demon You Know} (level 60+) is available after completing 'For the Birds'.

